# Declaration of the ACP States on Article 95 of the Convention

This scope records the key dates and financial details related to the ACP States' declaration concerning Article 95 of the Convention.

```catala
declaration scope ACPDeclaration:
  input signing_date content date
  input official_journal_date content date
  input assistance_amount content money
  output declaration_date content date
```

## Declaration Date

The declaration was published in the Official Journal on 22 December 1980.

```catala
scope ACPDeclaration:
  date round down
  definition declaration_date equals official_journal_date
```